   "evidence": "`private def smulPair` and the `instance : SMul G l.ChiswellTree where smul k := lift (fun g a => if h : 2 \u2022 (a : \u039b) \u2264 l k + l g - l (k * g) then mk k \u27e8l k - (a : \u039b), by have htri \u2026 grind, sub_le_self \u2026\u27e9 else \u2026)` contain the same terms and tactic blocks. `smul_mk` repeats them and is proved by `(rfl)`. The instance's well-definedness proof already goes through `smulPair_congr` and `dsimp only [smulPair]`.",
