   "issue": "The `instance : SMul G l.ChiswellTree` body (a `lift` of the `if 2 \u2022 a \u2264 l k + l g - l (k * g) then mk k \u27e8l k - a, \u2026\u27e9 else mk (k * g) \u27e8a + l (k * g) - l g, \u2026\u27e9` term) copies `smulPair` word for word, bound proofs included. `ChiswellTree.smul_mk` copies it a third time. The bridging lemmas `smul_mk_eq_quotientMk` and `smul_eq_chiswellSMul` exist only to reconnect the copies.",
